# Everything ACTIVA tracks is in LensLog/ (rules: LensLog/.gitignore) or .github/.
# Anything else at the root is a local leftover from before the 21 Nov move
# (venv, videos, caches, installed weights) and stays untracked.
/*
!/.github/
!/LensLog/
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
